  "description": "LDAP / Active Directory server-side IAuthProvider for ToolUp.Platform: authenticates against Active Directory or generic LDAP by binding as the user (proof-of-possession), with service-bind user search, RFC-4515 injection-safe filters, LDAPS-by-default channel binding, nested-group resolution, and group-to-role mapping. For regulated / on-premise / air-gapped deployments that cannot reach an external OIDC issuer. System.DirectoryServices.Protocols only, no vendor SDK.",
